---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Create([run create])
    Pending[Chunk pending]
    Dispatch[Dispatch window marks dispatched_at]
    ClaimGuard{Run running and chunk claimable?}
    Leased[Chunk leased]
    Recover{Coordinator recovery budget left?}
    RecoveryEvent[Recovery event enqueued]
    LoadCases[Load case batch]
    Process{Processing outcome}
    CompleteGuard{Still leased by same worker?}
    Completed[Chunk completed]
    ReleaseGuard{Still leased by same worker?}
    Requeued[Chunk pending for retry]
    Cancel([run cancel])
    Cancelled[Chunk cancelled]
    Failed[Chunk failed]
    Noop[No transition]

    Create --> Pending

    Pending --> Dispatch --> ClaimGuard
    Leased -->|Lease expired| Recover
    Recover -- Yes --> RecoveryEvent --> Pending
    Recover -- No --> Failed
    ClaimGuard -- Yes --> Leased --> LoadCases --> Process
    ClaimGuard -- No --> Noop

    Process -- Success --> CompleteGuard
    CompleteGuard -- Yes --> Completed
    CompleteGuard -- No --> Noop

    Process -- Execution retry wait --> ReleaseGuard
    Process -- Recoverable failure --> ReleaseGuard
    ReleaseGuard -- Yes --> Requeued --> Pending
    ReleaseGuard -- No --> Noop

    Pending --> Cancel
    Leased --> Cancel
    Cancel --> Cancelled

    Leased -. Reserved terminal path .-> Failed

    class Create,Cancel command
    class Pending,Dispatch,Leased,Recover,RecoveryEvent,ClaimGuard,LoadCases,Process,CompleteGuard,ReleaseGuard,Requeued system
    class Completed success
    class Cancelled,Failed error
    class Noop component
